<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa trade data expected from Thurs - official.</title>
<headline>S.Africa trade data expected from Thurs - official.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>May trade data was likely to be released from Thursday onwards, a Customs and Excise spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The May data had been tentatively scheduled for release on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Economists polled by Reuters expect a 850 million rand surplus in the month from a 730 million rand surplus in April.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
